This node contains no third-party source code and no model weights. It runs on
ComfyUI's own native Marigold V2 support and uses the following works, which are
installed separately and keep their own licenses:

- Marigold V2 (huawei-bayerlab) - Apache License 2.0
  Code:    https://github.com/huawei-bayerlab/marigold-v2
  Weights: https://huggingface.co/huawei-bayerlab/marigold-v2-0

- Qwen-Image-Edit-2509 (Qwen team, Alibaba) - Apache License 2.0
  The backbone model Marigold V2 runs on.

- ComfyUI (Comfy Org) - GNU General Public License v3.0
  Native Marigold V2 nodes and model loading.

- kornia - Apache License 2.0
  Python dependency (already part of a standard ComfyUI install).

